I think that's right.
我觉得是的。

00:27:41.220 --> 00:27:42.700
I think it was the best for everybody.
我觉得这对所有人都最好。

00:27:42.700 --> 00:27:44.900
You know, I also have a strong memory in it.
你知道，我对这件事也有深刻的记忆。

00:27:44.900 --> 00:27:47.539
And I've always been grateful for her, for this.
而且我一直为此很感激她。

00:27:49.660 --> 00:27:54.059
TV Guide wanted to photograph her and put her on the cover.
《电视指南》想给她拍照片，并把她放到封面上去。

