She wanted to be with like someone from the show.
她想和剧里的某个人待在一起。

00:28:03.779 --> 00:28:07.740
So Britney Spears and I ended up on the cover of TV guide together.
所以我和布兰妮·斯皮尔斯最后一起上了《电视指南》的封面。

00:28:07.740 --> 00:28:09.740
Oh my God, we've had weird lives.
天哪，我们的人生还真是奇特。

00:28:09.740 --> 00:28:11.380
Yeah, we've had strange lives.
是啊，我们的人生都很怪异。

00:28:11.380 --> 00:28:18.059
And I remember, I made a joke that I don't think she was kind of thrown by it, but they were taking our picture.
我记得，我开了一个玩笑，我觉得她当时有点不知所措，不过当时他们正在给我们拍照。

00:28:18.059 --> 00:28:20.740
And I just leaned over, I was like, is this your photo?
我凑过去说，这是你的照片吗？

00:28:20.740 --> 00:28:22.819
