You know, I actually, to be honest, memory of it is not weird at all it was more just like it was just fun and almost in the same way that the two-minute date felt like a dance it felt like a bit of a dance you know like like kind of like okay doing this and and I think that's a really a tribute to you guys because it very quickly like we're talking very quickly like my memory that was right away felt extremely comfortable and obviously like as an actor like everyone's gonna do their best work when they're comfortable and I you know I think I'd met Kobe before, because all Canadians have met.
你知道，说实话，我对那段记忆一点也不觉得诡异，更多的是觉得有趣。差不多就像那场两分钟的约会一样，感觉像是一支双人舞，真的就像跳了一小段舞，你知道的，就那种“好吧，开始拍这个”的感觉。我觉得这真的要归功于你们，因为很快——我们说的是非常快——我的记忆是，我立刻就感到了极度的舒适。显然，作为演员，每个人在感到舒适时都会发挥出最好的水平，而且我知道，我以前可能见过科比，因为所有加拿大人都见过。

