01:02:04.579 --> 01:02:07.619
I loved I almost walked out five times in the movie too.
我太喜欢了，我在电影里也差点退场五次。

01:02:07.619 --> 01:02:20.179
Like the way they're both agreeing on the bit, the yes-ending that's happening between these two people who have chemistry who are in the way, the way you're just committing to the bit right away with Ted, like it just felt, you guys have really good chemistry.
就像他们俩对这个桥段的默契一样，这两个有化学反应、又互相妨碍的人之间发生的这种顺着对方往下接的互动，你们一开始就对泰德的这个桥段全情投入，感觉就是，你们俩的化学反应真的很好。

01:02:20.179 --> 01:02:26.940
Like you want to see more of you too, which was of course the plan, although I don't think we told anyone that, but we knew we wanted to do back.
就像你想看到你们俩更多对手戏一样，当然这也是计划的一部分，虽然我觉得我们没告诉任何人，但我们知道我们想回归。

01:02:26.940 --> 01:02:30.380
And we actually, we're trying to make a movie in 15 seconds, which I really like that.
而且实际上，我们试图在15秒内拍完一部电影，我很喜欢这一点。

01:02:30.380 --> 01:02:32.380
15 seconds, that was great.
15秒，那太棒了。

01:02:32.380 --> 01:02:33.219
That was great.
太棒了。

01:02:33.219 --> 01:02:35.420
Well, look, send the great Sarah Chalk.
话说回来，感谢伟大的莎拉·查克。

01:02:35.420 --> 01:02:39.300
I mean, you're a funny, smart, and great Sarah Chalk.
我是说，你既搞笑、聪明，又是一位伟大的莎拉·查克。

01:02:39.300 --> 01:02:42.699
We've taken up too much of your time, I feel.
我觉得我们占用了你太多时间了。

01:02:42.699 --> 01:02:47.739
No, thank you guys so much for having me and thank you for having me on all of those episodes.
不，非常感谢你们邀请我，也谢谢你们让我参与了所有这些剧集。

01:02:47.739 --> 01:02:55.099
I look back at it as one of the most fun things I've gotten to do in my career.
我回想起来，认为这是我职业生涯中最有趣的事情之一。

01:02:55.099 --> 01:02:55.940
It was so fun.
真的太有趣了。

01:02:55.940 --> 01:03:00.380
Every day was such a pleasure on set, and that's a tribute to the environment that you created, and I'm sure that's a constant.
在片场的每一天都是一种享受，这要归功于你们创造的环境，我相信这也是一贯如此的。

01:03:00.380 --> 01:03:01.219
It always felt...
感觉总是……

01:03:01.219 --> 01:03:02.460
Everybody who comes on.
每个来的人。

01:03:02.460 --> 01:03:04.619
It always felt like a treat every time you were on set.
每次你来到片场，都觉得像是一种犒劳。

01:03:04.619 --> 01:03:09.980
Like really, I loved our storyline, I loved working with you.
真的，我很喜欢我们的故事线，我也很喜欢和你合作。

01:03:09.980 --> 01:03:13.460
We may bug you again in season four to come talk about one of the later episodes.
我们可能会在第四季再次麻烦你，来聊聊后面的某一集。

01:03:13.460 --> 01:03:14.300
We'll see.
到时候再说。

01:03:14.300 --> 01:03:16.380
Oh yeah, I would love it.
噢，当然，我非常愿意。

01:03:16.380 --> 01:03:18.599
And then when you guys do your reboot.
然后等你们拍重启版的时候。

01:03:18.599 --> 01:03:27.780
I am guilty, please equip me, all sins are forgiven, in New York City.
我有罪，请装备我，所有的罪孽都将被宽恕，在纽约市。

